H('102.d.3.B',3,"Used finishing rags soaked with oil can spontaneously combust, so they should be:","Stored in a closed metal container or laid flat to dry",["Left in a pile","Thrown in a trash can","Stored near heaters"],"Oily rags are a fire hazard.")
